    "sections": {
        "description": "FSE Responsive is a modern, block-based child theme designed to leverage the full power of WordPress Full Site Editing (FSE). Built with speed, SEO, and user experience in mind, this theme is perfect for corporate businesses, digital agencies, portfolios, and eCommerce storefronts.  It comes seamlessly integrated with WooCommerce, allowing you to build and customize your online store entirely through the Site Editor. FSE Responsive includes a versatile collection of pre-designed block patterns—such as Hero Banners, Pricing Tables, Testimonials, Services Grids, and specialized WooCommerce product layouts (Featured, Recent, and On-Sale products). Whether you are launching a startup, a professional blog, or a full-scale online shop, FSE Responsive offers incredible flexibility. Easily customize your typography, color palettes, headers, footers, and responsive grid layouts without writing a single line of code. Enjoy a lightweight, translation-ready, and highly adaptable theme that ensures your website looks stunning on all devices."
    },
